<Layout title="About"><div class="wrap about-page"><section class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE ABOUT ME</p><h1>Curious by nature.<br/>Practical by design.</h1><p>I'm Jomari Francis Villanueva, an educator, researcher, and technology practitioner in Iligan City, Philippines.</p></section><section class="section detail-grid"><div class="about-emblem" aria-hidden="true">jv<span>.</span></div><div class="prose"><h2>Connecting the pieces.</h2><p>My work spans AI automation, connected devices, and the people who use them. At Future AI Lab / BrandNat, I worked on AI workflows, agents, and content intelligence.</p><p>At MSU-IIT, I teach Computer Applications and head the Policy Center for Emerging Trends & Technologies. These roles connect my technical practice with education and technology policy.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href={path('cv/')}>View CV ↗</a><a class="text-link" href={path('research/')}>Research ↗</a><a class="text-link" href={path('teaching/')}>Teaching ↗</a></div></div></section></div></Layout>
